  "details": "Currently, the Avatar Details on the big menu are padded way too much.\n\nOn the quick menu, there are 7 items with reasonable padding. On the big menu, despite being two columns and being taller than the quick menu, there are only only 10. \n\nThere is an excessive amount of padding on the big menu. It makes it difficult to read with such significant padding. The padding should be reduced, similar to the quick menu. I also believe the avatar download size should be included anyways, even though it would be redundant, just for consistency (since the big menu should be a much more detailed breakdown).\n\nAttached are 3 images. The first is showing the quick menu. The second is showing the current big menu. And the third is me simply copying and pasting the quick menu details into a single image that I was sending to someone.",
